<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Refund Policy</h1><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> <span>›</span> Refund Policy</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:820px">
<p style="color:var(--gray-500);margin-bottom:32px">Last updated: January 2025</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:12px">Registration &amp; Admission Fees</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">Registration fees are non-refundable. Admission fees paid upon confirmation of a seat are also non-refundable once a seat has been allocated, as it results in the rejection of other applicants.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Tuition Fees</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">Tuition fees paid for a term are refundable on a pro-rated basis only if a student withdraws before the 15th of the first month of that term. No refund is provided after the 15th. Fees paid for subsequent terms that have not commenced will be fully refunded upon written withdrawal notice.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Withdrawal Process</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">To initiate a withdrawal and request a refund, parents must submit a written application to the school office. Refunds, if applicable, will be processed within 30 working days via the original mode of payment.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Exceptional Circumstances</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">In case of genuine hardship or exceptional circumstances, requests for fee adjustments may be considered by the management on a case-by-case basis.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Contact</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9">For fee-related queries, contact the accounts department at <a href="mailto:<%= school.email %>" style="color:var(--green)"><%= school.email %></a>.</p>
</div></section>
